contract.task_clause:
Which PyTorch 1.8 command(s) produce $10\times 5$ Gaussian matrix with each entry i.i.d. sampled from $\mathcal{N}(\mu=5,\sigma^2=16)$ and a $10\times 10$ uniform matrix with each entry i.i.d. sampled from $U[-1,1)$?
Option A: \texttt{5 + torch.randn(10,5) * 16} ; \texttt{torch.rand(10,10,low=-1,high=1)}
Option B: \texttt{5 + torch.randn(10,5) * 16} ; \texttt{(torch.rand(10,10) - 0.5) / 0.5}
Option C: \texttt{5 + torch.randn(10,5) * 4} ; \texttt{2 * torch.rand(10,10) - 1}
Option D: \texttt{torch.normal(torch.ones(10,5)*5,torch.ones(5,5)*16)} ; \texttt{2 * torch.rand(10,10) - 1}
